spice
* NMOS Transistor
M1 2 5 4 4 NMOS

* Voltage Sources
V1 2 3 DC 2
V2 4 3 DC 1

* Node Definitions
* Net 2: Connected to Drain of NMOS and Positive terminal of V1
* Net 5: Connected to Gate of NMOS
* Net 4: Connected to Source/Body of NMOS and Positive terminal of V2
* Net 3: Ground reference

.model NMOS NMOS (Level=1)
.end